---
description: Rust workspace boundary rules
globs:
  - "crates/**/*.rs"
  - "crates/**/Cargo.toml"
  - "apps/**/*.rs"
  - "apps/**/Cargo.toml"
alwaysApply: false
---

Read @AGENTS.md and @crates/AGENTS.md. For `apps/**`, also read @apps/AGENTS.md.
External GUI, renderer, runtime, PTY, and OS crate types must stay inside adapters or
composition roots and must not leak into stable contracts.
